"""Original AI-assisted educational cards; no textbook passages are reproduced.

The Algorithm Design Manual informed topic selection. Synthetic query wrappers
are not independent natural-language conversations. Challenge descriptions are
kept out of training. See the evaluation report for that distinction.
"""
